ire-bonding and cavity-packaging capabilities.</p></div><div style="border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius-card); overflow:hidden; background:#fff; display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr); align-items:stretch;"><div style="padding:28px 30px;"><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:21px; font-weight:600; color:var(--ink); line-height:1.2; letter-spacing:-0.01em; margin:0 0 12px;">Built on Hana's sensor packaging and micro assembly technologies</h3><p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--ink-2); line-height:1.65; margin:0 0 20px; max-width:560px;">Sensor packaging uses die attach, wire bonding and cavity-close processes from Hana's microelectronics operations, adapted to the mechanical, environmental and electrical requirements of the sensor.</p><div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; gap:10px;"><a href="/capabilities/microelectronic-assembly" style="font-size:11px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--hana-blue); text-decoration:none; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; white-space:nowrap; line-height:1.4;">See Microelectronic Assembly <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a><a href="/markets/optical-sensors" style="font-size:11px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--hana-blue); text-decoration:none; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; white-space:nowrap; line-height:1.4;">See optical sensor packaging technologies <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div><div style="border-left:1px solid var(--line); padding:28px 30px; display:flex; align-items:center;"><div style="width:100%; aspect-ratio:16 / 10; border-radius:6px; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--white); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:10px;"><img src="/images/mk-automotive-sensor-assembly-samples.webp" alt="A sample of assembled automotive sensor packages" style="display:block; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:contain;" /></div></div></div></div></div><div style="background:#071f35; border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:40px 0;"><div style="max-width:976px; padding:0 48px;"><div class="auto-sechead on-dark"><h2>Where it&#39;s made</h2><p>Sensor assembly is supported in Thailand and China on lines with temperature, humidity and particulate controls appropriate to the device.</p></div><div class="auto-plants" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);"><a class="auto-plantcard" href="/locations/ayutthaya" style="text-decoration:none; color:inherit;"><div><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Thailand</span><div class="nm">Ayutthaya</div></div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="auto-plantcard" href="/locations/jiaxing" style="text-decoration:none; color:inherit;"><div><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> China</span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div></div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="font-size:13px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5); line-height:1.5; margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75); text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;">View all locations &rarr;</a></p></div></div><div style="background:var(--bg); border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:40px 0 48px;"><div style="max-width:976px; padding:0 48px;"><div class="auto-sechead"><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div class="auto-faq"><div class="item is-open"><button type="button" class="q"><span class="num">01</span><h3 class="qt">What sensor types can Hana assemble?</h3><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-down" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i></span></button><div class="panel"><span></span><p>Hana supports MEMS-based pressure, inertial and acoustic sensors, optical proximity and ambient-light detectors, and radar front-end modules in cavity, LCC and custom package formats.</p></div></div><div class="item "><button type="button" class="q"><span class="num">02</span><h3 class="qt">How is stress managed at the die-attach level?</h3><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-down" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i></span></button><div class="panel"><span></span><p>Die-attach material, cure profile and substrate stiffness are selected to minimize induced mechanical stress on the sensing element, helping maintain output stability through assembly and operation.</p></div></div><div class="item "><button type="button" class="q"><span class="num">03</span><h3 class="qt">What environment controls are in place?</h3><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-down" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i></span></button><div class="panel"><span></span><p>Assembly areas maintain controlled temperature, humidity and particulate levels appropriate to the device type. Cavity packages are closed within the controlled environment to reduce contamination before sealing.</p></div></div></div><div style="margin-top:22px; padding-top:18px; border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><a href="/markets/automotive" style="font-size:12px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.07em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--hana-blue); text-decoration:none; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; white-space:nowrap; line-height:1.4;"><i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the Automotive market hub</a></div></div></div><section class="auto-cta auto-cta--spoke" style="background:var(--hana-blue-deep);" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-accent="cyan" data-fade="none"><div class="inner"><div><h2>Have an automotive sensor to build?</h2><p>Send the device and its role in the vehicle. We'll come back with a packaging approach and an indicative plan.</p>